  "_about": "Box summons the original server kept to itself: chapter summons (one per main chapter plus Dark Memories, paid with that chapter's ticket, featured prizes per player refilled on the 1st of each month at 08:00 UTC) and Mama's Dream summons (paid with their own ticket, limited prizes shared by every player on the server). Each draw costs one ticket and gives one prize. Each draw picks by weight among the unlimited prizes and the limited (featured) ones still in stock; featured prizes are rarer by having smaller weights. Gems go to the gift box, everything else straight to the inventory.",
